OL,3,GNEWSAGrave of missing WW1 soldier
OL,4,Arededicated to him
OL,5,
OL,6,FA missing soldier from Surrey has had a
OL,7,Fpreviously unnamed grave rededicated to
OL,8,Fhim, 108 years after his death.
OL,10,FWhile leading a group of men fighting
OL,11,FGerman soldiers during World War One,
OL,12,F2nd Lt Frank Fleming, from Guildford,
OL,13,Fdied near Hollebeke in Belgium on 11
OL,14,FApril 1918.
OL,16,FAfter being listed as missing for
OL,17,Fyears, Fleming's grave was eventually
OL,18,Ffound in the Voormezeele Enclosure No.3
OL,19,Fin Ypres, where the gravestone was
OL,20,Freplaced with one carrying his name at
OL,21,Fa ceremony on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
